electronics with things like Walkmans and TVs and DVD
players and Honda cars. But what happened? It just feels

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:30.900
like there's this huge gap between technology from Japan in
like the 80s and 90s to now in 2021. How did Japan fall

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:37.710
behind? And what challenges does a face currently? And what
are they doing right now to address it? And you know, being

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:45.810
a YouTuber, I was kind of like, maybe I should make a video
about this. Soooo here we go. Oh, quick note. By the way, a

