made. And at this point, I think Japan kind of knew that was

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:55.350
like, on the downhill, you know, like birth rates are
declining, and the population is aging. And there wasn't

00:10:55.380 --> 00:11:02.370
anybody who could compete with any of these big Silicon
