00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:15.990
that allowed for a more flexible working environment. And
this only happened like three years ago. So I think it just

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:22.020
took Japan a little bit of time to figure out what worked
for them. But of course, challenges still lie ahead for

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:23.460
Japan's tech economy.

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:34.850
While there's more new tech startups in Tokyo than ever
